   "text": "pg_stat_activity: state = active\n                  wait_event_type = Lock\n                  wait_event = transactionid\npg_locks: transactionid  ShareLock  granted = f  737\n          tuple  ExclusiveLock (B 자신이 가진, 그 행)",
